  "unresolved": [
    "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 4807 is not established: 25C.MES is named only from GROUND.MES's opaque tail, and the caller's global_u8[350] write at 4791 lies before the origin.",
    "What moves the F word banked_u16[200] and clears the six flags (global_u8[100], global_u8[104], global_u8[1545], global_u8[107], global_u8[1648], global_u8[1504]) is not established -- the callee touches neither the F word nor the E word banked_u16[202].",
    "The callee asks no question; it counts global_u8[128] when the E word banked_u16[202] is in 31..100 at its entry -- once more on a reentry, before the done-gate returns -- sets global_u8[1648] (its own gate and a conjunct of the guard), stamps banked_u16[242] = 25 (the value A03's guard refuses), and writes global_u8[286].",
    "The clock ladders select global_u8[3253].",
    "state_u16[8] is rewritten at 272 before it is read, and global_u8[4000] reads 0 at the callee's entry whatever is seeded.",
    "N_PIC.MES native presentation and GROUND.MES past the door are not measured.",
    "done_cell = the guard's cleared flag the event sets",
    "effect on global_u8[128] depends on the entry state (observed final values [0, 1]); v3 has no delta effect",
    "effect on global_u8[3253] depends on the entry state (observed final values [1, 2]); v3 has no delta effect"
  ]
